## Escalation & Support

### When to Seek Help

1. **Data loss or corruption** - Backup and document before attempting fixes
2. **Repeated unexplained errors** - Gather logs and system info
3. **Performance degradation** - Monitor resource usage trends
4. **Integration breaking changes** - Check HA release notes and integration docs

### Information to Gather

Before asking for help:

- [ ] Home Assistant version
- [ ] Error messages from logs
- [ ] Steps to reproduce
- [ ] Recent changes (last 7 days)
- [ ] Relevant configuration snippets
- [ ] System resources (CPU, memory, disk)

